onse[\"events\"]`\n\n**Code updated (`src/incident_handoff/adapter.py`):**\n- Added handling for Responses wire format where message content can be a list of `{\"type\": \"output_text\", \"text\": \"...\"}` objects\n- Preserves `call_id` for tool calls and results\n\n**Code fixed (`src/incident_handoff/replay.py`):**\n- Fixed `replay_from_serialized()` to preserve `call_id` for both `tool_call` and `tool_result` events, ensuring proper tool-result correlation during replay\n\n**Code updated (`src/incident_handoff/render.py`):**\n- Added `call_id` to tool_result output for proper correlation visibility\n\n**Documentation updated (`docs/migrations/responses-cutover.md`):**\n- Added comprehensive migration guide covering event ordering, tool-result correlation via `call_id`, and event-sourced replay semantics\n\nAll 3 tests pass."}}
